:: Apartment Living Room
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isOlder()>><<goto "Garden South Street">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("apartment-living-room", "Garden South Street — Apartment")>>\
You stand in the living room of your apartment.

<<icon "bedroom">><<link "Go to Bedroom <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Apartment Bedroom">><</link>>
<<icon "kitchen">><<link "Go to Kitchen <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Apartment Kitchen">><</link>>
<<gap>>
<<icon "apartment-hall">><<link "Leave Apartment <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Apartment Hallway">><</link>>
<<icon "apartment-ml-door">><<link "Leave Apartment Complex <span class='action-time'>(0:03)</span>">><<run World.advance(3)>><<goto "Garden South Street">><</link>>
